    {
      "id": "u_8d2dd225d16921668da9af9c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Instead of exporting full ZIPs (including the root note), consider using __TRILIUM_PH_0__backups__TRILIUM_PH_1__ instead. Backups always contain the entire structure, as well as additional information a ZIP export does not have: maintains note IDs, contains the options/tokens and handle __TRILIUM_PH_2__Protected Notes__TRILIUM_PH_3__ better.",
      "sourceHash": "8d2dd225d16921668da9af9cecaf18a36545988ab0ac2dfe0a13a4a784a95e7b",
      "context": "Import & Export > Exporting the root note",
