      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Exporting a chapter with __TRILIUM_PH_0__This note & all descendants__TRILIUM_PH_1__ writes the pictures and files of each page as its attachments. Importing that archive creates an ordinary copy that you can edit, with its pictures and the links between its pages working.",
